#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With millions of residents in small facilities globally, the need for a secure,\n"
"            integrated system has never been higher. This package leverages Odoo's powerful core\n"
"            modules to transform how small homes manage staff, legal records, and daily care.\n"
"            Ultimately, we are giving care teams the tools to refocus on their true mission: <b>providing\n"
"            a safe, supportive environment for every resident, not just managing clicks.</b>"
msgstr ""
"Con millones de residentes en centros pequeños alrededor del mundo, la "
"necesidad de un sistema seguro\n"
"            e integrado nunca ha sido tan grande. Este paquete aprovecha los "
"potentes módulos\n"
"            principales de Odoo para transformar la forma en que los centros "
"pequeños gestionan al personal, los registros legales y el cuidado diario.\n"
"            En definitiva, damos al personal de cuidado las herramientas "
"para volver a enfocarse en su verdadera misión: <b>ofrecer\n"
"            un entorno seguro y de apoyo para cada residente, no solo "
"gestionar clics.</b>"

#. module: community_care
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:community_care.welcome_article_body
